    "phone.transferEffect": {
      "comment": "Private tracking-phone selection only, not public competition transfer. No remote device names are known. Keep concise. Unreceived includes old-phone observations recorded before selection but received afterward; known old folds remain in totals. Do not suggest event timestamps determine inclusion. Non-English copy is an AI draft; see docs/localization.md.",
